s=ledger.read_text(encoding='utf-8')
banner='''\n> **Authoritative continuation acceptance — 2026-10-12:** backend1935 passed/0 failed; frontend7 passed and final production build passed;16 controlled Playwright scenarios passed. Candidate image built and tested, never activated. Release verdict BLOCKED: required successful new live Portal acquisition remains unavailable (upstream403/candidate502). Deployed Oracle still fails six contract checks. The current acceptance lines below and appended checkpoint supersede earlier provisional classifications, migration0021 alert references, and desktop-blocked statements. No production app restart, migration or user-data test writes occurred.\n'''
